38">tsutaerare</span><span begin="03:06.638" end="03:07.095">ru</span></text></transliteration></transliterations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="03:09.855"><div begin="00:00.797" end="03:07.095"><p begin="00:00.797" end="00:03.494" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:00.797" end="00:01.597">メガネを</span><span begin="00:01.597" end="00:02.464">外し</span><span begin="00:02.464" end="00:02.813">て</span><span begin="00:02.813" end="00:03.494">さ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将眼镜摘下吧</span></p><p begin="00:03.693" end="00:06.246" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:03.693" end="00:03.946">ちゃ</span><span begin="00:03.946" end="00:04.480">んと目</span><span begin="00:04.480" end="00:04.848">を</span><span begin="00:04.848" end="00:05.556">合わせ</span><span begin="00:05.556" end="00:06.246">てよ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">认真直视对方的眼睛</span></p><p begin="00:06.668" end="00:09.273" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:06.668" end="00:07.335">カメラの</span><span begin="00:07.335" end="00:07.668">シャッ</span><span begin="00:07.668" end="00:08.236">ター</span><span begin="00:08.236" end="00:08.769">を切っ</span><span begin="00:08.769" end="00:09.273">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在按下相机快门的那瞬间</span></p><p begin="00:09.472" end="00:12.596" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:09.472" end="00:09.864">恋</span><span begin="00:09.864" end="00:10.248">を閉</span><span begin="00:10.248" end="00:10.816">じ込</span><span begin="00:10.816" end="00:11.334">めて</span><span begin="00:11.334" end="00:12.596">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将爱恋封存于心</span></p><p begin="00:18.848" end="00:21.522" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:18.848" end="00:19.293">山</span><span begin="00:19.293" end="00:19.626">あり</span><span begin="00:19.626" end="00:19.994">谷</span><span begin="00:19.994" end="00:20.576">ありの</span><span begin="00:20.576" end="00:21.077">恋で</span><span begin="00:21.077" end="00:21.522">す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是一段跌宕起伏的爱恋</span></p><p begin="00:21.772" end="00:24.536" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:21.772" end="00:22.551">三角</span><span begin="00:22.551" end="00:23.967">に口を尖らせ</span><span begin="00:23.967" end="00:24.536">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你将嘴撅成了三角形</span></p><p begin="00:24.684" end="00:27.081" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:24.684" end="00:25.431">四角い</span><span begin="00:25.431" end="00:25.807">言</span><span begin="00:25.807" end="00:26.151">葉の</span><span begin="00:26.151" end="00:26.492">角</span><span begin="00:26.492" end="00:27.081">取って</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我磨平了棱角分明的话语</span></p><p begin="00:27.081" end="00:29.531" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:27.081" end="00:27.401">君</span><span begin="00:27.401" end="00:28.313">にハートを</span><span begin="00:28.313" end="00:29.046">送りた</span><span begin="00:29.046" end="00:29.531">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想把真心毫无保留赠予你</span></p><p begin="00:30.638" end="00:33.209" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:30.638" end="00:31.918">sin,cos,</span><span begin="00:31.918" end="00:33.209">tanθ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Sin,cos,tanθ</span></p><p begin="00:33.371" end="00:36.043" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:33.371" end="00:34.126">心の</span><span begin="00:34.126" end="00:34.433">角</span><span begin="00:34.433" end="00:35.542">度が広がっ</span><span begin="00:35.542" end="00:36.043">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心与心的夹角正在扩大</span></p><p begin="00:36.222" end="00:38.783" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:36.222" end="00:37.027">電流</span><span begin="00:37.027" end="00:37.710">が走る</span><span begin="00:37.710" end="00:38.783">一目惚れ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">浑身过电那般一见钟情</span></p><p begin="00:38.783" end="00:41.294" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:38.783" end="00:39.153">覚</span><span begin="00:39.153" end="00:39.898">えていて</span><span begin="00:39.898" end="00:40.631">フレミン</span><span begin="00:40.631" end="00:41.294">グ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请铭记弗莱明的左手定则</span></p><p begin="00:42.229" end="00:44.801" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:42.229" end="00:42.770">純度</span><span begin="00:42.770" end="00:43.136">100</span><span begin="00:43.136" end="00:43.690">パーの</span><span begin="00:43.690" end="00:44.237">想い</span><span begin="00:44.237" end="00:44.801">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要将纯度100%的心意</span></p><p begin="00:45.163" end="00:47.835" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:45.163" end="00:46.358">以心伝心</span><span begin="00:46.358" end="00:47.123">させたい</span><span begin="00:47.123" end="00:47.835">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将心比心地传达给你</span></p><p begin="00:47.982" end="00:50.375" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="00:47.982" end="00:49.267">君と私は</span><span begin="00:49.267" end="00:50.375">正反対</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你我性格截然相反</span></p><p begin="00:50.375" end="00:52.902" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="00:50.375" end="00:50.743">恋</span><span begin="00:50.743" end="00:51.444">はいつも</span><span begin="00:51.444" end="00:52.902">想定外</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">恋爱总让人措手不及</span></p><p begin="00:52.902" end="00:54.735" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="00:52.902" end="00:53.601">ねぇねぇ</span><span begin="00:53.601" end="00:54.001">聞い</span><span begin="00:54.001" end="00:54.735">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 呐 听我说</span></p><p begin="00:55.047" end="00:58.787" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="00:55.047" end="00:55.431">言</span><span begin="00:55.431" end="00:56.524">葉を尽くして</span><span begin="00:56.524" end="00:57.092">君に</span><span begin="00:57.092" end="00:57.975">伝えたい</span><span begin="00:57.975" end="00:58.787">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想倾尽所有话语将心意传达给你</span></p><p begin="00:58.857" end="01:01.791" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="00:58.857" end="00:59.929">心が</span><span begin="00:59.929" end="01:00.497">体</span><span begin="01:00.497" end="01:01.396">に追いつい</span><span begin="01:01.396" end="01:01.791">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心绪开始跟随身体而行</span></p><p begin="01:01.791" end="01:03.944" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:01.791" end="01:03.391">気づけば目で追って</span><span begin="01:03.391" end="01:03.944">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">回过神来视线便追逐着你</span></p><p begin="01:04.419" end="01:07.122" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:04.419" end="01:05.171">メガネを</span><span begin="01:05.171" end="01:06.054">外し</span><span begin="01:06.054" end="01:06.403">て</span><span begin="01:06.403" end="01:07.122">さ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将眼镜摘下吧</span></p><p begin="01:07.334" end="01:10.047" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:07.334" end="01:07.550">ちゃ</span><span begin="01:07.550" end="01:07.899">んと目</span><span begin="01:07.899" end="01:08.467">を</span><span begin="01:08.467" end="01:09.166">合わせ</span><span begin="01:09.166" end="01:10.047">てよ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">认真直视对方的眼睛</span></p><p begin="01:10.230" end="01:12.904" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:10.230" end="01:10.785">恋は</span><span begin="01:10.785" end="01:11.350">走</span><span begin="01:11.350" end="01:11.902">り出し</span><span begin="01:11.902" end="01:12.904">たの</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">恋爱开始狂奔驰骋</span></p><p begin="01:13.104" end="01:15.875" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:13.104" end="01:13.880">放課後</span><span begin="01:13.880" end="01:14.429">まで</span><span begin="01:14.429" end="01:14.963">待て</span><span begin="01:14.963" end="01:15.875">ない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">根本就等不到放学了</span></p><p begin="01:15.997" end="01:18.681" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:15.997" end="01:16.786">大事な</span><span begin="01:16.786" end="01:17.336">言</span><span begin="01:17.336" end="01:18.021">葉ほ</span><span begin="01:18.021" end="01:18.681">ど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">越是重要的话语</span></p><p begin="01:18.890" end="01:21.840" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="01:18.890" end="01:19.666">酸素を</span><span begin="01:19.666" end="01:20.552">嫌う</span><span begin="01:20.552" end="01:20.952">みた</span><span begin="01:20.952" end="01:21.840">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">似乎越讨厌被氧化</span></p><p begin="01:21.962" end="01:24.775" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="01:21.962" end="01:22.885">辞書に無い</span><span begin="01:22.885" end="01:23.421">私</span><span begin="01:23.421" end="01:23.986">なりの</span><span begin="01:23.986" end="01:24.775">言葉で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我要用词典里没有 独属于我的话语</span></p><p begin="01:24.895" end="01:28.711" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="01:24.895" end="01:25.586">早く</span><span begin="01:26.843" end="01:27.411">君に</span><span begin="01:27.411" end="01:28.161">伝えな</span><span begin="01:28.161" end="01:28.326">きゃ</span><span begin="01:28.326" end="01:28.711">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">快点对你表明我的心意</span></p><p begin="01:33.930" end="01:36.651" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="01:33.930" end="01:34.674">世界の</span><span begin="01:34.674" end="01:35.922">7割は海</span><span begin="01:35.922" end="01:36.274">です</span><span begin="01:36.274" end="01:36.651">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这个世界有7成是海洋</span></p><p begin="01:36.982" end="01:39.657" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="01:36.982" end="01:37.704">私の</span><span begin="01:37.704" end="01:38.403">脳内</span><span begin="01:38.403" end="01:39.155">メーカー</span><span begin="01:39.155" end="01:39.657">じゃ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可是我脑海的制造厂里</span></p><p begin="01:39.859" end="01:42.269" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="01:39.859" end="01:40.611">9割</span><span begin="01:40.611" end="01:41.328">くらいは</span><span begin="01:41.328" end="01:42.269">君のこと</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大概有9成全都关于你</span></p><p begin="01:42.269" end="01:44.979" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="01:42.269" end="01:42.611">あと</span><span begin="01:42.611" end="01:43.482">1割は</span><span begin="01:43.482" end="01:44.263">食べるこ</span><span begin="01:44.263" end="01:44.979">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">剩下的1成都是吃的吧</span></p><p begin="01:45.811" end="01:48.285" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="01:45.811" end="01:47.104">本音建前</span><span begin="01:47.104" end="01:47.819">使い分</span><span begin="01:47.819" end="01:48.285">け</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">灵活运用真心与客套</span></p><p begin="01:48.726" end="01:51.300" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="01:48.726" end="01:49.457">心の</span><span begin="01:49.457" end="01:50.340">中は雨</span><span begin="01:50.340" end="01:50.724">あら</span><span begin="01:50.724" end="01:51.300">れ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可我心中却雨雪夹击</span></p><p begin="01:51.597" end="01:53.965" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="01:51.597" end="01:51.994">初</span><span begin="01:51.994" end="01:53.079">めて見たその</span><span begin="01:53.079" end="01:53.965">髪型</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">第一次看到你那个发型</span></p><p begin="01:53.965" end="01:56.561" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="01:53.965" end="01:55.832">褒めることもできぬま</span><span begin="01:55.832" end="01:56.561">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却连一句称赞都说不出口来</span></p><p begin="01:57.412" end="01:59.984" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37"><span begin="01:57.412" end="01:57.953">純度</span><span begin="01:57.953" end="01:58.319">100</span><span begin="01:58.319" end="01:58.873">パーの</span><span begin="01:58.873" end="01:59.420">想い</span><span begin="01:59.420" end="01:59.984">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要将纯度100%的心意</span></p><p begin="02:00.327" end="02:02.999" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38"><span begin="02:00.327" end="02:01.522">以心伝心</span><span begin="02:01.522" end="02:02.287">させたい</span><span begin="02:02.287" end="02:02.999">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将心比心地传达给你</span></p><p begin="02:03.220" end="02:05.485" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39"><span begin="02:03.220" end="02:03.721">いつも</span><span begin="02:03.721" end="02:04.071">本</span><span begin="02:04.071" end="02:05.172">音はかくれん</span><span begin="02:05.172" end="02:05.485">ぼ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真心话总是在跟我玩捉迷藏</span></p><p begin="02:05.553" end="02:07.866" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40"><span begin="02:05.553" end="02:07.345">引き寄せ合うマグネッ</span><span begin="02:07.345" end="02:07.866">ト</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们就像彼此吸引的磁铁般</span></p><p begin="02:08.068" end="02:09.882" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41"><span begin="02:08.068" end="02:08.788">ねぇねぇ</span><span begin="02:08.788" end="02:09.156">聞い</span><span begin="02:09.156" end="02:09.882">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 呐 听我说</span></p><p begin="02:10.202" end="02:13.882" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42"><span begin="02:10.202" end="02:10.586">言</span><span begin="02:10.586" end="02:11.679">葉を尽くして</span><span begin="02:11.679" end="02:12.247">君に</span><span begin="02:12.247" end="02:13.130">伝えたい</span><span begin="02:13.130" end="02:13.882">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想倾尽所有话语将心意传达给你</span></p><p begin="02:14.013" end="02:16.903" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43"><span begin="02:14.013" end="02:14.611">どうし</span><span begin="02:14.611" end="02:15.144">て</span><span begin="02:15.144" end="02:15.477">喉(ここ)</span><span begin="02:15.477" end="02:16.389">まで来てる</span><span begin="02:16.389" end="02:16.903">のに</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明话语都已经涌上了我的喉咙</span></p><p begin="02:16.944" end="02:19.116" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44"><span begin="02:16.944" end="02:17.310">あと</span><span begin="02:17.310" end="02:17.643">一</span><span begin="02:17.643" end="02:18.560">文字が言え</span><span begin="02:18.560" end="02:19.116">ない？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可为何一个字都说不出来?</span></p><p begin="02:19.620" end="02:22.272" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45"><span begin="02:19.620" end="02:20.369">メガネを</span><span begin="02:20.369" end="02:21.236">外し</span><span begin="02:21.236" end="02:21.601">て</span><span begin="02:21.601" end="02:22.272">さ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将眼镜摘下吧</span></p><p begin="02:22.490" end="02:25.203" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46"><span begin="02:22.490" end="02:22.733">ちゃ</span><span begin="02:22.733" end="02:23.266">んと目</span><span begin="02:23.266" end="02:23.568">を</span><span begin="02:23.568" end="02:24.384">合わせ</span><span begin="02:24.384" end="02:25.203">てよ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">认真直视对方的眼睛</span></p><p begin="02:25.424" end="02:28.092" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47"><span begin="02:25.424" end="02:25.933">恋が</span><span begin="02:25.933" end="02:26.482">走</span><span begin="02:26.482" end="02:27.066">り出し</span><span begin="02:27.066" end="02:28.092">たら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">待到恋爱狂奔驰骋后</span></p><p begin="02:28.301" end="02:30.916" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48"><span begin="02:28.301" end="02:29.051">誰にも</span><span begin="02:29.051" end="02:29.368">止</span><span begin="02:29.368" end="02:30.162">めらんな</span><span begin="02:30.162" end="02:30.916">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那么任谁都无法阻止了</span></p><p begin="02:31.175" end="02:33.839" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49"><span begin="02:31.175" end="02:31.964">大事な</span><span begin="02:31.964" end="02:32.514">言</span><span begin="02:32.514" end="02:33.199">葉ほ</span><span begin="02:33.199" end="02:33.839">ど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">越是重要的话语</span></p><p begin="02:34.071" end="02:37.021" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50"><span begin="02:34.071" end="02:34.847">酸素を</span><span begin="02:34.847" end="02:35.733">嫌う</span><span begin="02:35.733" end="02:36.133">みた</span><span begin="02:36.133" end="02:37.021">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">似乎越讨厌被氧化</span></p><p begin="02:37.127" end="02:39.994" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51"><span begin="02:37.127" end="02:37.740">辞書も</span><span begin="02:37.740" end="02:39.158">言い訳もすぐに</span><span begin="02:39.158" end="02:39.994">仕舞って</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以不论词典还是借口全都立刻收起</span></p><p begin="02:40.084" end="02:43.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52"><span begin="02:40.084" end="02:41.057">君を</span><span begin="02:42.015" end="02:42.796">追いかけ</span><span begin="02:42.796" end="02:43.130">ない</span><span begin="02:43.130" end="02:43.370">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是再不追上你的话</span></p><p begin="02:43.370" end="02:48.961" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53"><span begin="02:43.370" end="02:44.055">想</span><span begin="02:44.055" end="02:44.239">い</span><span begin="02:44.239" end="02:44.772">が</span><span begin="02:44.772" end="02:45.274">強</span><span begin="02:45.274" end="02:46.192">すぎて</span><span begin="02:46.192" end="02:46.909">音</span><span begin="02:46.909" end="02:47.109">割</span><span begin="02:47.109" end="02:47.826">れし</span><span begin="02:47.826" end="02:48.576">そう</span><span begin="02:48.576" end="02:48.961">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这份心意似乎会因太过强烈而破音吧</span></p><p begin="02:49.082" end="02:54.874" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54"><span begin="02:49.082" end="02:50.026">涙</span><span begin="02:50.026" end="02:50.559">が</span><span begin="02:50.559" end="02:52.159">乾いて世</span><span begin="02:52.159" end="02:52.872">界の</span><span begin="02:52.872" end="02:54.354">ピントが合う</span><span begin="02:54.354" end="02:54.874">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">待到泪水风干后世界才终于清晰地对焦</span></p><p begin="02:55.056" end="03:00.689" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55"><span begin="02:55.056" end="02:57.587">一生分の</span><span begin="02:57.757" end="02:58.291">恋</span><span begin="02:58.291" end="02:59.373">を燃や</span><span begin="02:59.373" end="03:00.689">せ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">燃尽这一生的爱恋吧</span></p><p begin="03:00.868" end="03:03.142" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56"><span begin="03:00.868" end="03:02.113">メガネをそっと</span><span begin="03:02.113" end="03:02.476">外</span><span begin="03:02.476" end="03:02.879">した</span><span begin="03:02.879" end="03:03.142">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当我轻轻地摘下眼睛之后</span></p><p begin="03:03.182" end="03:07.095" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57"><span begin="03:03.182" end="03:03.537">やっ</span><span begin="03:03.537" end="03:04.086">と</span><span begin="03:05.137" end="03:05.726">君に</span><span begin="03:05.726" end="03:06.638">伝えられ</span><span begin="03:06.638" end="03:07.095">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">才终于将心意传达给你</span></p></div></body></tt>